  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-27T11:39:51-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 27, 2020, 11:39 am\">June 27, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div>It started out sunny then became overcast but what fun watching the families come to catch crabs, a birder came to see the Sandhill Crane while walkers greeted us. Join the Guild next Thursday 7/2,  we will be painting at the <a href=\"https://www.capecodlavenderfarm.com/\">Cape Cod Lavender Farm</a> in Harwich.</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"5319-1\" class=\"gallery gallery-5319 gallery-col-2 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-large\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-2d0f8f55efdb7f2524e3/\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/19796be1913127237d006436db14541a74ec460039c9c72add8c22be779409dc.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A painting of a river with colored crayons on a table.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption id=\"figcaption-5319-5295\" class=\"gallery-caption\">Bell’s Neck, Harwich</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-06eb295389741d2bea92/\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/b47e9a4564d8980b43f24fb734ad9990028b5c0886abbcd6729bbf8ba31b300b.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman with glasses and a painting on a easel.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption id=\"figcaption-5319-5323\" class=\"gallery-caption\">Chris Banks</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-5606c8eee54b0cd9da0b/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/3bf7d2e99e2c953c07cfafb701e13ea354dbbf0fbc0896c566b85bb4cc92137a.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman holding an easel in front of a grassy area.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption id=\"figcaption-5319-5321\" class=\"gallery-caption\">Peggy Orbon</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-0dfd8f24fb705c5e330e/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/cb10722810f0fe718e1390c2178862278f5610eb174a39035c2c762baed2fc40.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A man holding an umbrella while painting near a body of water.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption id=\"figcaption-5319-5320\" class=\"gallery-caption\">Rich Orbon</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-1948dc5f1d563e977436/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1022\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/d8391a2300abbd5d3feb60d3b37abed4dc11a26d84b6fe35b7ed2fe4b8426a65.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Join us for our weekly en plein air.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-32cd4b4ee490840b3094/\" rel=\"tag\">EN PLEIN AIR</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
